yeah, 挑発 あたしたちは no doubt
Yeah, provocation, we're no doubt!

239
00:24:50,629 --> 00:24:53,129
緑のあいつにばっか構ってんね
Just obsessing over that green one, huh?

240
00:24:53,129 --> 00:24:54,929
さぁ burn up
Come on, burn up!

241
00:24:54,929 --> 00:24:57,129
いつになったら貰える合格
When am I gonna get a passing grade?

242
00:24:57,129 --> 00:24:59,629
赤ペン入れてよ どこがダメなんですか
Mark it with a red pen, what's wrong with it?

243
00:24:59,629 --> 00:25:02,918
酒女金ドラッグ やっっちゃってコンプラ
Booze, girls, money, drugs, violating compliance!

244
00:25:04,706 --> 00:25:06,206
冗談じゃないって
You gotta be kidding me

245
00:25:06,206 --> 00:25:07,606
中指立てたくなるような事情
So many situations make me wanna raise my middle finger

246
00:25:07,606 --> 00:25:09,306
ありすぎて指が足りねぇから
I don't have enough fingers for them all, so...

247
00:25:09,306 --> 00:25:10,706
Hands up and what's up

248
00:25:10,706 --> 00:25:11,606
最低？
The absolute worst?

249
00:25:11,606 --> 00:25:13,006
元々だろ Bring it on
I was like that from the start! Bring it on!

250
00:25:13,006 --> 00:25:15,206
ママ、やっぱりあたしは
Mama, as I thought, I...

251
00:25:15,206 --> 00:25:17,606
こんなところじゃ終われない
...can't end in a place like this!

252
00:25:17,606 --> 00:25:19,606
ぬるくて気が触れそう
It's so lukewarm I'm losing my mind

253
00:25:19,606 --> 00:25:21,606
ごっこ遊びも芝居もさよなら
Goodbye to playing pretend and acting!

254
00:25:21,606 --> 00:25:24,606
ずっとこのままなんてさぁ いられないよ
I can't just stay like this forever!

255
00:25:24,606 --> 00:25:26,606
ダッダッダッ 僕ら大人になる
Da-da-da, we're gonna grow up

256
00:25:26,606 --> 00:25:28,606
カウンター狙い
Aiming for a counterattack,

257
00:25:28,606 --> 00:25:30,506
最低な日々に
At these terrible days,

258
00:25:30,506 --> 00:25:32,406
燦々とかます一撃
Striking a brilliant blow,

259
00:25:32,406 --> 00:25:34,406
誰も読めない先まで
Far beyond what anyone can predict!

260
00:25:34,406 --> 00:25:36,606
決まってんでしょ？
Isn't that obvious?

261
00:25:36,606 --> 00:25:38,206
いつも
Always,

262
00:25:38,206 --> 00:25:39,206
どれも
Everything,

263
00:25:39,206 --> 00:25:40,206
捨てて 捨てて
Throwing it all away,

264
00:25:40,206 --> 00:25:42,306
生きて 生き抜いて覆すわ
Surviving and turning it all around!

265
00:25:57,406 --> 00:25:59,506
ダッダッ くだらない
Da-da, so foolish,

266
00:25:59,506 --> 00:26:02,606
