あー あなたに捧げるわ 私の愛とやらスベテ
Ah, I'll dedicate everything—my "love" or whatever it is—to you.

598
00:50:12,990 --> 00:50:19,590
この手は私を守るためあったのね
These hands existed just to protect me, didn't they?

599
