爪を研ぎ その時を待て すべては一瞬のために
Sharpen your claws and wait for that moment; everything is for a single instant.

636
00:53:31,690 --> 00:53:34,590
覚悟しろ 最後の敵は 怯え続ける自分だ
Prepare yourself, the final enemy is your cowardly self.

637
