世界を変える劇薬は今
The powerful drug to change the world is now...

638
00:53:36,790 --> 00:53:42,790
仮面の裏のアイドル 狂気と覚悟で貫け
The idol behind the mask—pierce through with madness and resolve!

639
00:53:42,990 --> 00:53:46,590
泥を舐めても 絶望の果て 壊滅の最前線
Even if licking the dirt, at the end of despair, on the front lines of destruction,

