In an instant, a tearful face...

642
00:54:00,790 --> 00:54:09,790
すべてをこの一瞬に賭けて放て Last-resort
Stake everything on this single moment and release Last-resort!

643
00:54:13,790 --> 00:54:19,790
僕のすべてを込めて放つ Last-resort
Unleashing Last-resort with all my heart!

644
00:54:21,790 --> 00:54:27,290
あなたがくれた希望で
With the hope you gave me,

645
00:54:27,590 --> 00:54:31,790
約束の羽で今
